  "reason": "The evidence strongly identifies scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted (config_040, acc=0.7250) as the best configuration. The only untested combination within this top encoder pairing is avgpool + concat (config_021). While transformer has consistently outperformed avgpool (0.725 vs 0.706 for weighted), testing the concat fusion with avgpool completes the 2×2 aggregation×fusion grid for the best encoder pair and rules out any interaction effect where concat might partially compensate for avgpool's weaker aggregation. As the final experiment with no remaining budget, this is the highest-expected-accuracy untested option in the primary multimodal design space and provides the most definitive characterization of whether the current best (config_040) is truly the ceiling for this encoder combination."
